  description: Captured DMG 24212 gives a nil applicable amount for the sentenced-prisoner branch of
    24197(1) and explicitly says a claimant with a nil applicable amount is not entitled. DMG 24214
    allows possible remand entitlement with allowable housing costs, otherwise nil. Definitions,
    detention dates, hospital legislation and partner treatment must be read separately; prisoner
    here includes a sentence by a criminal, civil or military court.
